Author: Artem Lavrukhin <lavryha4590@gmail.com>
Description: Preserve notification icons across ReactOS and Wine processes.
 Transfer icon pixels, accept Wine notification packets, and measure the tray
 from its toolbar. Support version 4 callback packing, keyboard activation,
 hover notifications and NIF_SHOWTIP while retaining versions 0 and 3.
